                <pb facs="0789" n="779" xml:id="pg779"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Appendix II</hi></head>
                <p>[Here is omitted a report, dated January 15, 1920, of the committee appointed to
                    consider the reopening of certain trading relations with the Russian people. For
                    text of the report, see appendix A to ICP–18, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1919Parisv09/pg_868">Volume IX, page 868</ref>. Its nine
                    main points are also set forth in the telegram quoted in appendix I, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">supra.</hi>]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
